Package: distroclone
Version: 1.4.9
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, rsync, xorriso, mtools, syslinux-utils, syslinux-common, isolinux, imagemagick
Recommends: yad, zenity, grub-efi-amd64, efibootmgr, calamares, calamares-settings-debian, os-prober, fdisk, live-boot, live-config, live-config-systemd
Suggests: polkitd | policykit-1
Maintainer: Franco Conidi aka edmond <fconidi@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://www.syslinuxos.com
Description: DistroClone - Universal Live ISO Builder
 Create customized bootable live ISO images from any running
 Debian-based system (Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Elementary OS,
 SysLinuxOS, LMDE, and derivatives).
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-detect distribution, version and desktop environment
  - YAD/Zenity graphical interface with DC branding
  - Calamares installer integration with custom branding
  - UEFI and Legacy BIOS boot support
  - Squashfs compression options (xz, lz4, xz+bcj)
  - Real-time build log window
  - Success/error completion dialogs
  - Automatic cleanup of live packages after installation
